# Used when the build context is the repo root: `docker build -f pipeline/Dockerfile .` and
# `railway up . --service api`. Allow-list only what the console API image copies; the big image
# caches (data/cache/streetview, data/cache/satellite ~230 MB) and node/web/mcp trees stay out.
# (mcp/ and web/ are built with their own directory as the context, so this file does not affect them.)
*
!pipeline/requirements.txt
!pipeline/doorscore
!pipeline/tests
!data/territory.geojson
!data/out
!data/eval
!data/cache/acs_tracts.json
!data/cache/parcels_*.geojson
!data/cache/vision
!data/cache/vision_satellite
!data/cache/streetview_meta
!data/cache/permits
!data/cache/census_tract
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
**/.venv
**/.env
